        "label": "Java 基础",
        "title": "JVM 内存小测",
        "description": "选择一个答案，查看对应解释。",
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "id": "question",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "普通对象实例通常存放在哪个运行时内存区域？",
        "variant": "h3"
      },
      {
        "id": "answers",
        "component": "ChoicePicker",
        "label": "选择答案",
        "value": {
          "path": "/answer"
        },
        "variant": "mutuallyExclusive",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Java 堆",
            "value": "heap"
          },
          {
            "label": "Java 虚拟机栈",
            "value": "stack"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "heap-explanation",
        "component": "LingUI.Conditional",
        "condition": {
          "op": "includes",
          "args": [
            {
              "path": "/answer"
            },
            "heap"
          ]
        },
        "child": "heap-text"
      },
      {
        "id": "heap-text",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "回答正确。普通对象实例通常分配在堆中，由垃圾收集器管理；具体分配还受逃逸分析等优化影响。",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "stack-explanation",
        "component": "LingUI.Conditional",
        "condition": {
          "op": "includes",
          "args": [
            {
              "path": "/answer"
            },
            "stack"
          ]
        },
        "child": "stack-text"
      },
      {
        "id": "stack-text",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "再想一想。虚拟机栈保存方法调用的栈帧，包括局部变量、操作数栈等；局部变量可以持有对象引用。",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      {
        "id": "reset",
        "component": "Button",
        "child": "reset-label",
        "variant": "secondary",
        "events": {
          "click": {
